    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Distinguish carefully between 'A number of' (plural verb) and 'The number of' (singular verb) in error-spotting questions.",
        "Remember that 'Many a' is always followed by a singular noun and a singular verb, despite its plural meaning.",
        "Uncountable nouns like 'furniture', 'advice', 'information', and 'machinery' always take singular verbs."
      ],
